# flow-rename
flow rename adt "ADT In"
flow rename adt "ADT Inbound"
flow rename nope x
--- stdout
{"id":"adt","name":"ADT In","sourceType":"","status":"undeployed","enabled":true,"destinations":[{"name":"out","type":"file","dir":"$DIR/out"}]}
{"id":"adt","name":"ADT Inbound","sourceType":"","status":"undeployed","enabled":true,"destinations":[{"name":"out","type":"file","dir":"$DIR/out"}]}
--- stderr
Error: no flow with id or name "nope"
--- exit 2
